2026,UgxLMOhCS6jBpeUpSw94AaABAg,Deh08ch_CXE,,"Taishita koto nai kara sa
Since it’s really no big deal,

Sorya nantomo nai kedo ne
and of course it doesn’t bother me,

Sora miagete me shoboru
but looking up at the sky, my eyes grow misty.

Nanka itsumo no hi janai ya
It’s just not my usual day.

Kinou hare dattakke ame janakatta you na
Was it sunny yesterday? I don’t think it rained,

Shashin totte mikaesu to
but looking back at the photos I took,

Nanka sugoku yosaso na mono tabeteru ne
I’m eating something that looks incredibly good.

Kutsuzure ga itaku tomo itaku tomo
Even if my blister hurts, even if it really hurts,

Aruku yo mae o muite never give up
I’ll keep walking forward, never giving up,

Demo yappa itai kara sa itai kara sa
but it still hurts so much, it really hurts,

Nanka chotto dake me shoboru
and my eyes grow just a little bit misty.",10,2026-08-30T00:48:49Z,2026-08-30T00:48:49Z,1,2026-10-27T12:57:09.066263+00:00
